For indexed symlinks, _blob unconditionally calls readlink. In a legitimate core.symlinks=false checkout, Git stores the link payload in a regular worktree file; Rule 1 therefore exits with an input error even for clean content. Minimal fix: support that regular-file representation through the existing no-follow read strategy, as the Rule 2 reader already does.

